    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9635" root="حون" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَانَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A place where wine is sold;</i> (Msb and
TA in this art., and S and K in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حين</span>;) the
<i>place of the vintner;</i> (Kr;) the ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَانُوت</span></b>  [or <i>shop</i>]
<i>of the vintner:</i> pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَانَاتٌ</span>: (S, Msb:) thought by
AHn to be from the Persian <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَانَهْ</span>. (TA.)

